# Development happens on Windows, CI runs on Linux. Normalize to LF in the
# repository so ruff/pre-commit line-ending checks are deterministic on both.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary / generated artifacts: never touch, never diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pkl binary
*.joblib binary
*.parquet binary
uv.lock -diff linguist-generated=true

# Notebooks diff poorly; outputs are stripped by pre-commit anyway.
*.ipynb -diff linguist-detectable=false
